        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-05-03T20:34:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\n\nDo you think that something like vdm_wait_timer would then be a better name for this field? That would make the cable-discovery case less obviously spec-compliant, but the other cases would be less surprising to the reader.",
